# Playground conventions

- Keep the Todo demo minimal: one Express API + static HTML/CSS/JS frontend.
- Prefer small, readable changes over refactors when completing exercises.
- Do not add frameworks (React, Vue, etc.) unless an exercise explicitly asks.
- API lives under `/api/todos`. Persist to `playground/data/todos.json`.
- When fixing bugs for Debug exercises, leave a short comment explaining the root cause.
